Site Report: Monokpo-street, Bori Metropolis.

The vertical electrical sounding (VES) at this station indicates a five-layer subsurface sequence. The resistivity starts at 1426 ohm-m, decreases to 569 ohm-m in the second layer, and then follows a continuous increasing trend through layers 3 (1241 ohm-m), 4 (1931 ohm-m), and 5 (2994 ohm-m). Based on these values, the calculated curve type is HAA. Please note that the existing survey classification on file, which identifies the station as Q-type, is incorrect and does not align with the interpreted layer resistivities.

{"curve_type_stated": "HAA", "label_issue_flagged": true}

